            # 110d. ★★ DNS 候选并行实测（串行 12.5s → ≈2.5s；判定口径不变，保留 probeTls(hostname, ip)）
            ('        val verified = ArrayList<java.net.InetAddress>(2)\n        val tried = ArrayList<String>(5)\n        for (ip in candidates.take(5)) {\n            tried += ip\n            if (probeTls(hostname, ip)) verified += java.net.InetAddress.getByName(ip)\n            if (verified.size >= 2) break\n        }\n', '        val verified = ArrayList<java.net.InetAddress>(2)\n        val tried = ArrayList<String>(5)\n        // ★ 第 110 轮提速：候选**并行实测**。\n        // 原来逐个串行 probeTls（每个 2500ms 上限）⇒ 最坏 5×2.5 = 12.5 秒，而且这段还跑在\n        // OkHttp 的 Dns 回调线程上（直接决定该次请求能否开始建连）。qinav / xchina 一族在\n        // 本机网络下系统解析常被污染，冷启动第一发最容易被这里拖住。\n        // 改为并发发出、按候选顺序取前两个成功的：最坏 ≈ 2.5 秒，判定口径不变。\n        val cand = candidates.take(5)\n        val probed = java.util.concurrent.ConcurrentHashMap<String, Boolean>()\n        val workers = cand.map { ip ->\n            Thread { probed[ip] = runCatching { probeTls(hostname, ip) }.getOrDefault(false) }\n                .apply { isDaemon = true; name = "x99probe" }.also { it.start() }\n        }\n        for (w in workers) runCatching { w.join(3500) }\n        for (ip in cand) {\n            tried += ip\n            if (probed[ip] == true) verified += java.net.InetAddress.getByName(ip)\n            if (verified.size >= 2) break\n        }\n'),
