            ('    fun selectTab(t: String) {\n        tab = t\n        X99.putSetting("ui.tab", t)\n        detail = null\n        webPage = null\n        x99Focus = null\n        when (t) {\n            "latest" -> board = "sites"\n            "home" -> {\n                board = "hanime"; mode = ListMode.HOME; activeTab = null\n                if (rows.isEmpty()) loadHome()\n            }\n            else -> board = "hanime"\n        }\n    }', '    fun selectTab(t: String) {\n        tab = t\n        X99.putSetting("ui.tab", t)\n        detail = null\n        webPage = null\n        x99Focus = null\n        showHanimeLines = false\n        // ★ 第 75 轮修（用户报的真 bug）：「点击某个板块后，点切换其他页面和板块会滞留页面，\n        //   除非我手动点左上角返回键，比如看完播放历史再点底栏收藏就会停留」。\n        //\n        // 根因：这里原来**只在 "home" 分支重置 mode**。用户从「收藏」格点进一份清单后\n        // （mode = LIST），再点底栏的「用户」格，mode 仍是 LIST —— 于是那一格里的\n        // `if (mode == ListMode.LIST)` 分支继续渲染**上一格留下的清单页**，看起来就是"页面滞留"。\n        //\n        // 修法：**切底栏 = 回到该格的根页面**，一律重置 mode 与页码/tab。\n        // 这与用户对底栏的直觉一致（底栏是「换一格」，不是「在这一格里往下钻」）。\n        mode = ListMode.HOME\n        activeTab = null\n        page = 1\n        detailLoading = false\n        when (t) {\n            "latest" -> board = "sites"\n            "home" -> {\n                board = "hanime"\n                if (rows.isEmpty()) loadHome()\n            }\n            else -> board = "hanime"\n        }\n    }'),
