                '    var settingsOpen by remember { mutableStateOf(false) }\n    // ★★ LABFIX_ANR（实验分叉 · 2026-10-31）：主页链接 / 账号 id 的兜底**改异步**。\n    //\n    // 上游（第 80 / 93 轮）把 HanimeClient.userId() 直接写进了 Composable 的**实参**\n    // （UserRow 副标题、remember 的 lambda）—— 那两处都在**主线程同步执行**，\n    // 而 userId() 内部是同步 HTTP（GET https://hanime1.me/）。\n    // 结果：一进用户页就卡主线程 → ANR。\n    //\n    // 真机实测（NetGuard 抓的栈）：\n    //   HanimeClient.userId → UserTab → RecomposeScopeImpl.compose\n    //\n    // 修法：这两个值都在 IO 线程取一次，界面只读状态。\n    var homeFallback by remember { mutableStateOf<String?>(null) }\n    var uidAsync by remember { mutableStateOf("") }\n    LaunchedEffect(user, profile) {\n        if (profile != null) { homeFallback = null; uidAsync = ""; return@LaunchedEffect }\n        if (user == null) { homeFallback = null; uidAsync = ""; return@LaunchedEffect }\n        val pair = kotlinx.coroutines.withContext(Dispatchers.IO) {\n            val uid = runCatching { HanimeClient.userId() }.getOrNull().orEmpty()\n            val home = if (uid.isBlank()) null else HanimeClient.BASE + "/user/" + uid\n            Pair(home, uid)\n        }\n        homeFallback = pair.first\n        uidAsync = pair.second\n    }',
